<mxCell id="p3-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="A worker inside the engine reads a store file from S3 and applies each row as if it were UpsertStore. A bad row never blanks a live store. Not a topic: nobody else reads the file.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
